        <mxCell id="NzZDHhcIZEIHubJ28rXp-108" parent="1" style="text;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" value="&lt;ul style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Helvetica; font-size: 12px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: left; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(236, 236, 236); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none;&quot;&gt;pen_config_controller&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none;&quot;&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none;&quot;&gt;1 state update event&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;기준 최대 RTL 지연:&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none;&quot;&gt;1 cycle / 10 ns&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none;&quot;&gt;구조적으로는 거의 같은 타이밍이고, 보인 차이는&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;code style=&quot;forced-color-adjust: none;&quot;&gt;10 ns&lt;/code&gt;&lt;span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;수준&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" vertex="1">
